Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2

Package: auto-transcriber
Architecture: amd64
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10),
         python3-pip,
         python3-venv,
         python3-dbus,
         python3-gi,
         ffmpeg
Recommends: libnotify-bin
Description: Automatic media file transcriber using Gemini AI
 Watches a configurable source directory for new audio and video files,
 extracts audio with ffmpeg, and transcribes it using the Google Gemini API.
 Results are saved as plain-text files in a configurable output directory.
 Runs as a KUbuntu/KDE system tray application with AUTO and MANUAL modes.
